  unitName: Pixy Leore
  unitId: 30152
  unitNumber: 227
  description: "A young boy who was raised by Titania as a pixy. Abandoned in a faeries\u2019
    grove as a baby, he grew up thinking he was a pixy until the day he realized
    he looked different than everyone else. Shocked to discover the truth about his
    childhood, he embarked on a journey to find other humans as a means of coming
    to terms with his new identity. While on his travels, he heard about the gods\u2019
    plan to destroy the world."
  summonDesc: "You\u2019re a human Summoner?<br>What would you say to helping<br>me
    protect the pixies?"
  fusionDesc: "I haven\u2019t felt this way in some time.<br>I feel... strong again,
    somehow."
